  "streakDays": "{days, plural, =0{No streak yet} other{day streak}}",
  "@streakDays": {
    "description": "Label under the streak page's hero figure, in every state — it names what the figure is and says nothing about whether today is recorded. A ', and today is open' variant (streakDaysOpen) was withdrawn: the flame's tint, the week row's last cell and the record button all carry that already. The figure is drawn separately, so the label carries no number of its own — and because 'day streak' is attributive it does not inflect, which is why there is no =1 case.",
